snippet.description:
This is the official YouTube channel of 𝗔𝗟𝗘𝗫 (봉황).

𝗔𝗟𝗘𝗫 (봉황), born Alex Isidro Mayo Kinchen, is a half Asian indie South Korean electropop artist and digital creative under his label 𝗠𝗬𝗧𝗛𝗦 & 𝗟𝗘𝗚𝗘𝗡𝗗𝗦 Records. He has collaborated with mix/master engineer IKEK (Shin Dong Ik), Annie Ko of Love X Stereo (co-writer of Boost), and producer Nam Dong Hyun on Gravity, continuing to expand his presence across the indie and K-pop scene.

@alex_5ft_microrapter

